  "description": "Erection of a single-storey lower-ground rear extension; including replacement of the upper ground floor window with a new door to the rear elevation;  creation of a rear terrace with associated metal railings, and steps with integrated platform lift to the rear garden; erection of a dormer to the front roof slope and replacement of the existing dormer to the rear roof slope with an enlarged dormer; replacement of the central window with a door to the front elevation at the lower ground floor; alterations to the front boundary treatment including installation of a pedestrian gate and raising of the wall at the front stairs; and erection of an outbuilding in the rear garden.\r\n",
